{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon01_title", "source_sha256": "d1f12a262a363774c8a912e3fca939e6d37a4bee228e4340fcc90732edb23fac", "ja": "このみとおでかけ1", "zh": "和木实外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4461a45c00b74b8f6b70d2f677df7010f24306ffc143b36da18ae8e472cca173", "ja": "このみとおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "与木实一同出游的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "60c2e7e02df8bed39a34f17a604ba1622493850781c0652c2f790110da76921b", "ja": "（このみさんの秋田でのお仕事。今日は男鹿半島の\nなまはげ体験だ。まずはリハーサルから！）", "zh": "（这是琴美在秋田的工作。今天要体验男鹿半岛的生剥鬼。先从彩排开始！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon01_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "0bf19ec02904cf92c2b299ddf5d0850b5408f42eaaa3b73ea950c23cbede5860", "ja": "く、来る……もうすぐ来るわよ。", "zh": "要、要来了……马上就要来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "86032b424bc31b8eac0708ecfbf738d10bbc370f8d07555f0d7b4360ea1b9cf0", "ja": "来ますね……ゴクリ。", "zh": "要来了……咕咚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon01_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "7a4b6c47fd11d30ab5ef11e3dec5f6ec386a0b083bdb048b0c0861ebc8f7064f", "ja": "で、でも私悪い子じゃないから大丈夫！　……って\nいうか、「子」じゃないし！　大人だし！", "zh": "可、可是我又不是坏孩子，所以没问题！……应该说，  \n我又不是“孩子”！我可是大人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "edb957dd79abcfe0c8690ad18f50a750be876e259b0d3588b11510a5f0c6f5fb", "ja": "そ、そうですね。大人だから大丈夫だと\n……思います。", "zh": "是、是这样。因为是大人，所以应该没问题……吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon01_1005_namahage", "source_sha256": "e8646ea9da85cbf398db0f07c9a09d24919a8c2440392194fb9009f5e91c9852", "ja": "わるいごはいねがー！", "zh": "有没有坏孩子——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon01_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "6657fd81c7f7b6e7b488b72b2b2c81cb0f6c611e5da312329e86466bd777e22c", "ja": "き、来たわっ！　……ん？　こっちに向かって来る！？\n嘘でしょ！　わ、私は24歳よ！", "zh": "来、来了！……嗯？正朝这边过来！？  \n不会吧！我、我可是24岁啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon01_1007_namahage", "source_sha256": "3b7ceb5dba8d38162e3fcdd118268591c34448257b2df4a36aa40b9bbc1b3fb0", "ja": "嘘つぐ子はこうだー！", "zh": "说谎的孩子要受罚啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon01_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "c5fff5aebbea327577946bc7f8603023328b13f7bbb8b24372e4d592068d7335", "ja": "嘘じゃない！　嘘じゃないってば！\nどうしたら……そ、そうだわ！", "zh": "没说谎！都说了我没说谎！\n要怎么……对、对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e4279049e226a4952ba131b8abb8bdb0c80dad1e88d06552846906672dcc28d6", "ja": "（このみさんが、免許証を取り出した！　なまはげの\n人が謝っている……この画、意外と面白いかも？）", "zh": "（这美小姐拿出了驾照！那个戴着生剥鬼面具的人正在道歉……这幅画面，意外地有点有趣？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon01_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "4f98fdeb77e257a9dba17084ee10f12d7683fe3bd81f740114d819b2fa369c4b", "ja": "わかればいいのよ、わかれば♪\nそれじゃ本番も、よろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "明白就好啦，明白就好♪\n那么正式录制时，也请多关照啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_039kon01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_039kon01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c73757c7e0cd66a35125bd1c5a25e5934dd30b8877b228d639fd2c8d07f32a7c", "ja": "（なまはげとすらわかり合ってしまう、このみさんの\n大人力……これは、見習わないとな……！）", "zh": "（竟然连生剥鬼都能和之美小姐互相理解，这份成熟的处事能力……我可得好好学习一下……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
